# Agreement of continuous measurements, Bland and Altman (1996a) four peak flow readings on 20 children. One fragment per line.
Intra-class correlation coefficient (one way random effects) = 0.887666
95% CI = 0.795982 to 0.948056
Estimated within-subjects standard deviation = 21.459749
Kendall's tau b = 0.164457
two sided P = 0.3296
Repeatability (for alpha = 0.05) = 59.482297
